{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lanternwood</strong> is a fantasy auto battler where you assemble a party, combine skills to create powerful combos, and battle through strategic PvE campaign runs. Each decision matters as you craft your party, chain abilities, and adapt to the challenges of every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a team of heroes and experiment with different skill combinations, timing, and synergies to overcome increasingly difficult battles. Every run offers a new layout of enemies, rewards, and strategic choices, keeping each campaign fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779980/extras/250cad85b4ce8d71a38ab8b3cd8a84b4.poster.avif?t=1773229120\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779980/extras/250cad85b4ce8d71a38ab8b3cd8a84b4.webm?t=1773229120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779980/extras/250cad85b4ce8d71a38ab8b3cd8a84b4.mp4?t=1773229120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party Building:</strong> Choose from a variety of heroes and assemble the party that best fits your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Combos:</strong> Chain abilities together on your units to create powerful effects that turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto Battler Combat:</strong> Set up your strategy and watch your party\u2019s skills automatically trigger in fast-paced battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Campaign Runs:</strong> Progress through a campaign with loss conditions inspired by competitive auto battlers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong> Each run is different with randomized encounters, rewards, and skill synergies to explore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lanternwood puts your tactical thinking and creativity to the test, offering endless combinations of heroes, skills, and strategies to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779980/extras/390308c2f7ea515da838ab9aa7b242df.poster.avif?t=1773229120\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779980/extras/390308c2f7ea515da838ab9aa7b242df.webm?t=1773229120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779980/extras/390308c2f7ea515da838ab9aa7b242df.mp4?t=1773229120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3779980?t=1773229120","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779980/3349cf4ab59e8c0e24c261c903012505383b5e95/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773229120","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779980/e59def48a9f9acf8d03c99d0096336f8214fdd4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773229120","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779980/e59def48a9f9acf8d03c99d0096336f8214fdd4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773229120","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lanternwood</strong> is a fantasy auto battler where you assemble a party, combine s